<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Stone/Webster said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Stone/Webster said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney reduced the rating on Stone &amp; Webster Inc to outperform from buy, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares opened down 5/8 to 40-3/8.</p>
</text>
